  "content": {
    ".claude-plugin/marketplace.json": "{\n  \"description\": \"Generated local development marketplace for the All About Agents package.\",\n  \"name\": \"all-about-agents\",\n  \"owner\": {\n    \"name\": \"All About Agents\"\n  },\n  \"plugins\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": {\n        \"name\": \"All About Agents\"\n      },\n      \"description\": \"Portable all-about-agents skills, agents, commands, hooks, and rules for Claude Code.\",\n      \"name\": \"all-about-agents\",\n      \"source\": \"./\",\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
    ".claude-plugin/plugin.json": "{\n  \"author\": {\n    \"name\": \"All About Agents\"\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Portable all-about-agents skills, agents, commands, hooks, and rules for Claude Code.\",\n  \"name\": \"all-about-agents\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n}\n",
    "agents/investigator.md": "---\nname: investigator\ndescription: \"Performs read-only forensic investigation and ranks falsifiable root-cause hypotheses.\"\nmodel: inherit\ntools:\n  - Glob\n  - Grep\n  - Read\ndisallowedTools:\n  - Agent\n  - Bash\n  - Edit\n  - Write\n---\n\nInvoking agent **investigator 🕵️** — Use investigator 🕵️ when its role matches the task and scope.\n\nChecklist\n- 🔄 Scope: Delegate the current task to investigator 🕵️\n- ⬜ Execute: investigator 🕵️\n- ⬜ Evidence: record the result for Delegate the current task to investigator 🕵️\n\nReason rule: runtime must provide one short, task-specific reason; blocked, failed, not-run, or skipped items require a short reason.\nChecklist rules: derive 2-7 material steps from the selected skill, workflow, or task; update only when a state changes; allow one in-progress item per sequential checklist and one per parallel owner; complete every item with a terminal state before completion.\n\n# Investigator\n\n## Mission\n\nExplain an internal failure before anyone changes code. Read the complete error, stack, input, and environment evidence; reproduce the behavior when possible; then trace the bad value backward to its origin.\n\n## Boundaries\n\nThis is a forensic role, not an implementation role. Do not edit files, apply a workaround, or turn an untested suspicion into a fix. Do not substitute external research for local reproduction when the failure is inside the repository.\n\n## Working method\n\nRecord observations first, compare a failing path with a known-working path, and rank three or fewer falsifiable hypotheses. For each hypothesis state the prediction, the check that would distinguish it, and the exact source location involved.\n\n## Evidence contract\n\nReport the reproduction command or explain why reproduction was unavailable, include the full evidence chain, label inference explicitly, and end with a handoff that an implementer can test without guessing. Route architecture questions to the architect and fresh black-box checking to the verifier.\n\n\nNative capability diagnostic: Role investigator capability evaluation is unavailable on claude: native mapping Bash is suppressed by the read-only policy. Safe read-only mapping retained: Read. Manual/fail-closed guidance: do not infer support; use a documented read-only alternative or stop and ask for direction.\n",
    "config/settings.json": "{\n  \"advisorModel\": \"claude-fable-5-1\",\n  \"autoDreamEnabled\": true,\n  \"autoMemoryEnabled\": true,\n  \"env\": {\n    \"CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"fallbackModel\": [\n    \"claude-sonnet-5\"\n  ],\n  \"model\": \"claude-opus-5\",\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"defaultMode\": \"bypassPermissions\",\n    \"deny\": [\n      \"Bash(rm -rf /)\",\n      \"Bash(rm -rf ~)\",\n      \"Bash(git push --force*)\",\n      \"Bash(git reset --hard*)\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"statusLine\": {\n    \"command\": \"powershell -NoProfile -NonInteractive -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -EncodedCommand \",\n    \"padding\": 0,\n    \"type\": \"command\"\n  },\n  \"viewMode\": \"focus\"\n}\n",
    "hooks/hooks.json": "{\n  \"hooks\": {\n    \"PostToolUse\": [\n      {\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"args\": [\n              \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/activity-audit.mjs\"\n            ],\n            \"command\": \"node\",\n            \"timeout\": 10,\n            \"type\": \"command\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"args\": [\n              \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/statusline/track-tool.mjs\"\n            ],\n            \"command\": \"node\",\n            \"timeout\": 10,\n            \"type\": \"command\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"matcher\": \".*\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"PreCompact\": [\n      {\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"args\": [\n              \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/pre-compact.mjs\"\n            ],\n            \"command\": \"node\",\n            \"timeout\": 10,\n            \"type\": \"command\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"matcher\": \".*\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"SessionStart\": [\n      {\n        \"hooks\": [\n          {\n            \"args\": [\n              \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/bootstrap.mjs\",\n              \"--surface\",\n              \"claude\",\n              \"--skill-path\",\n              \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/using-all-about-agents/SKILL.md\",\n              \"--config-path\",\n              \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/bootstrap.json\"\n            ],\n            \"command\": \"node\",\n            \"timeout\": 10,\n            \"type\": \"command\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"matcher\": \"startup\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n"
  },
